WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Kanemayu akupereka chidziwitso chachidule cha chipangizo cha Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Yatsani pogwiritsa ntchito batani la imvi.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Poyamba, malekezero onse a Arclight amatha kubwera nthawi imodzi.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Ngati sichikuyaka konse kapena magetsi achepa, batire likhoza kukhala lathyathyathya.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Lumikizani ndi chojambulira cha USB.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Mukalipira, magetsi obiriwira adzayatsa.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Pambuyo pa mphindi 15, iyenera kuyimitsidwa kwathunthu ndikugwira ntchito kwa maola angapo.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Kuyisiya padzuwa kumapangitsa kuti batire ikhale yokwanira.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Simudzafunika kusintha mabatire kapena mababu aliwonse.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
The mode pamene mapeto onse abwera ndi ntchito wamba.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Sinthani ku mawonekedwe a diso pogwira batani pansi kwa masekondi 15.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Kenako kwezani zala zanu ndikudinanso mwachangu pomwe kuwala kumang'anima.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Tsopano muli m'mawonekedwe amaso, pomwe ophthalmoscope idzawonekera

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
choyamba, ndiye anterior gawo loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Kubwereza masitepe awa kudzazungulira m'njira zitatu zosiyanasiyana.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
General ntchito, maso, ndiye makutu.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Mukasankha njira yomwe mukufuna, kukanikiza batani la imvi

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
amasintha momwe magetsi amawalira komanso momwe amayatsira kumapeto.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Onetsetsani kuti mwagwiritsa ntchito mapeto olondola polemba zolondola.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Diso lakunja limawunikidwa pogwiritsa ntchito loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Maonekedwe adzakhala omveka mukakhala pafupi kwambiri ndi diso pafupi ndi 6 cm.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
The fundal reflex imachitidwa kutalika kwa mkono pogwiritsa ntchito ophthalmoscope yolunjika.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Ngati mawonekedwe akuda, onani kuti choyikapo ma lens chili pamwamba.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
Pamalo awa, palibe ma lens pabowo lamaso ndipo reflex iyenera kukhala yomveka bwino.

25
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.180
The Arclight itha kugwiritsidwanso ntchito kujambula kanema wazizindikiro zachipatala

26
00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:53.760
ikalumikizidwa ku kamera ya foni yam'manja.

27
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.810
Mukalumikizidwa, dzenje lamaso la ophthalmoscope mwachindunji

28
00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:05.920
idzayikidwa mwachindunji chapakati pa mandala omwe kamera yanu yam'manja imagwiritsa ntchito mumayendedwe amakanema.

29
00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.800
Kamera imagwira ntchito ngati maso anu mukamayang'ana pabowo lowonera.

30
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.720
Kuti mutsimikize kuti ndi mandala ati oti mulumikizane ndi bowolo,

31
00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.760
tsegulani pulogalamu ya kanema pa foni yanu, ikani chala chanu pa lens iliyonse motsatana.

32
00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:27.100
Chinsalu chikada, mwaphimba mandala omwe amagwiritsidwa ntchito pavidiyo.

33
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.960
Chotsani pepala lachikasu kumbuyo kwa kopanira.

34
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.180
Ikani mfundo za muvi pakati pa mandala omwe amagwiritsidwa ntchito kujambula kanema.

35
00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.040
Akanikizire kopanira pansi mwamphamvu.

36
00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.150
Chotsani muvi.

37
00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:47.410
Chojambulacho chiyenera tsopano kukhala pamalo olondola.

38
00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:51.470
Kuti muwonere vidiyo ya reflex, sinthani pa ophthalmoscope yolunjika

39
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.770
kumapeto kwa Arclight ndikusankha kuwala kowala kwambiri ndikudina katatu.

40
00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.310
Onetsetsani kuti choyikapo ma lens chili pamwamba.

41
00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.820
Ndi kuwala koyang'ana kutali ndi foni kwa wodwala,

42
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.840
ikani Arclight mu kopanira ndikukokera zotanuka kuti muteteze.

43
00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.840
Kanikizani Arclight m'mwamba mpaka siyikupitilirabe.

44
00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.380
Bowo lowonekera la ophthalmoscope yolunjika

45
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.560
tsopano ikhala molunjika pakati pa disolo lomwe limajambula kanema.

46
00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.460
Kuti mulembe diso lakunja, gwiritsani ntchito mbali ina ya chipangizocho.

47
00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:34.160
Kuti mujambule zithunzi, tsegulani pulogalamu yamakanema ndikuwonera,

48
00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.020
kudzaza chinsalu ndi mawonedwe kupyolera mu dzenje loyang'ana.

49
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.000
Dinani mbiri ndikuyesa mayeso.

50
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.220
Dinani kuyimitsa ndikusunga kanema.

51
00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.200
Tsopano mutha kugawana ndi anzanu pamapulatifomu otetezedwa, obisika

52
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:53.260
kokha chifukwa cha zomwe mudalandira chilolezo kuchokera kwa wodwala.

53
00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.890
Sangalalani kugwiritsa ntchito Arclight pantchito yanu.
